  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDF MECOVI-Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The IDF Grant for MECOVI-Colombia is to support the National Statistical Office of Colombia (DANE) in their efforts to improve the household surveys of living conditions by providing technical assistance and expert support.  The proposed IDF Grant would support the plan of the Government of Colombia (GOC) to strengthen the National Administrative Department of Statistics# (Departamento Administrativo Nacional de Estadistica - DANE) capability to design and manage an Integrated System of Household Surveys (Sistema Integrado de Encuestas de Hogares # SIEH). The implementation of the SIEH would have the objective of: (i) providing timely and high-quality information to the central and to local governments in support of the design, management and monitoring of the National Development Plan (NDP)#s public policies and programs aimed at reducing poverty and inequality; and (ii) promoting analysis of socioeconomic data and dissemination of socioeconomic statistical information to a wide range of users, including civil society organizations.</narrative>
  </description>
